From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dallas Delaney <dadelan@microsoft.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 17:23:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] erofs: consume compact v2 signed artifacts

Discover one v2 referrer per platform manifest, retain its standard OCI graph, reconstruct each EROFS tar-index device from compact metadata plus the source layer, verify its standalone dm-verity tree before commit, and accept supported zstd layer media types.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

